OL,3,GNEWSAMotorists warned of burst water
OL,4,Amain on A47
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers are at the scene of a burst
OL,7,Fwater main on the A47 near
OL,8,FPeterborough.
OL,10,FAnglian Water said it was working on
OL,11,FThorney Hill to repair the pipe.
OL,13,FA spokesperson said: "We will continue
OL,14,Fto keep the situation under review and
OL,15,Fwork to minimise any impact on traffic
OL,16,Fand customers' water supplies."
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Police is asking
OL,19,Fmotorists to drive carefully as there
OL,20,Fis standing water on the road, although
OL,21,Fit remains open.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
